invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.h
catches: proof/prove-one.sh quic_driver
reason: ch_quic_init offers a kept ticket whose trust its configuration
  no longer holds, so a device resumes the tickets of a server key it
  rotated away. The quic_driver harness presents a ticket of any fields
  and requires that an accepted one passed the trust check.

--- old
    if (!hspost_trust_holds(cfg, &saved->ticket)) {
        return 0;
    }
--- new
